    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "R",
      "Pub. \u0026 Dist. Only by BOB ANDERSON POSTCARDS. 885-5th Ave.,\nW.N., Kalispell, Mont.\nGREAT FALLS INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\nGREAT FALLS, MONTANA:\nThe Great Falls area is served by one of the finest\nairports in the Northwest,\nlocated atop Gore Hill\non a high plateau overlooking Montana's largest\ncity. The modern\nterminal houses coffee shop,\ncocktail lounge\nand beautiful restaurant looking\nout the runways.\nP53171\nPUT\nSTAMP\nHERE\nLastichrome\nby COLOURPICTURE PUBLISHERS, INC., Boston 30, Mass., U.SA\nPOST CARD\nColor V Cord\nCREATION **\n2015,166.1965"
